                        <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip text-amber-400"></i> STM32 SMART DAQ & DIAGNOSTIC INSTRUMENT
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">ARM CORTEX-M4 • REAL-TIME MULTI-SENSOR ANALYZER</p>
